OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPartly cloudy to start with
OL,6,Fisolated light showers. Cloud builds
OL,7,Fwith showers becoming widespread
OL,8,Fthrough the morning and afternoon but
OL,9,Feasing later on. Showers will be
OL,10,Fmostly light with only the odd heavier
OL,11,Fburst in places. Temperatures around
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FMainly clear and dry through
OL,15,Fthe evening. Cloud builds after sunset
OL,16,Fwith some patchy light rain at times
OL,17,Fovernight and into Thursday morning.
OL,18,FMild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
