OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FCloudy with rain in the
OL,6,Feast, clearing through the morning to
OL,7,Fa dry and partly cloudy day for most
OL,8,Fwith only a very isolated shower.
OL,9,FFresh winds. Temperatures around
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,13,Funsettled to start the period with
OL,14,Ffurther light rain and blustery winds
OL,15,Fthrough Friday and into Saturday.
OL,16,FTurning drier and brighter on Sunday.
OL,17,FTemperatures remain around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
